{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/2025_MAIO_GIF_MADORA_2.gif?t=1748895798\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A third-person 3D roguelite like you've never seen before</strong>! Madora raises the bar for challenge with a new camera perspective, an original world inspired by Brazilian folklore, and a build system that demands creativity and innovation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/2025_MAIO_GIF_MADORA_3.gif?t=1748895798\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the world of Madora</strong>, a mythological land where Good fights to stop the advance of Evil and restore peace. Embark on your journey as unique characters\u2014from your tribe\u2019s strongest warrior, to an orc who masters giant beasts, to a furious monk who controls the winds. Each hero offers a distinct playstyle for you to explore and master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400300/extras/2025_MAIO_GIF_MADORA_4.gif?t=1748895798\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create builds like never before.</strong> With a system of active and passive skills that allows for over 100,000 combinations, Madora is a feast for those who love experimentation. Experience a new adventure with each playthrough, enjoying the best of the roguelite genre as you face armies of darkness and try to free the world of Madora from chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400300?t=1748895798","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset